+:: Mara Pet Cage Night
+<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<set $bus to "mara_pet_cage">>
+Mara closes the padded cage door and turns the key with a decisive click. "It's night. You're staying in the cage until seven. Don't bother arguing with the lock."
+<br><br>
+The cushion and folded blanket are still inside. The door is locked from the outside.
+<br><br>
+<<if $mara.nightCageCaughtUntil and Time.date.timeStamp lt $mara.nightCageCaughtUntil>>
+	Mara has already caught you trying the lock tonight. The punishment and return to the cage are still fresh in your memory. There will be no second attempt before morning.
+<<elseif currentSkillValue('skulduggery') gte 400>>
+	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 700>>
+	<<link [[Try to pick the cage lock|Mara Pet Cage Night Lockpick]]>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
+<<else>>
+	You consider the lock, but you do not have the Skulduggery skill needed to attempt it. You will have to wait until morning.
+<</if>>
+<br><br>
+<<bedicon "zzz">><<link [[Curl up on the cushion and sleep until 07:00|Mara Pet Cage Night Sleep]]>><</link>>
+
+:: Mara Pet Cage Night Lockpick
+<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 700>>
+<<skulduggerycheck>>
+<<skulduggeryuse>>
+<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
+	You work the tiny tool into the lock. After a tense moment, the mechanism gives with a soft click. You manage to open the cage without waking Mara.
+	<br><br>
+	<<link [[Slip out of Mara's house (0:02)|Mara Danube House Leave]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
+<<else>>
+	The pick slips. Metal scrapes loudly against the lock, followed by a sharp clatter. A light comes on in the hallway. You hear Mara's footsteps approaching.
+	<br><br>
+	<<if Time.hour lt 7>>
+		<<set $mara.nightCageCaughtUntil to Time.date.timeStamp + ((7 * 60 - (Time.hour * 60 + Time.minute)) * 60)>>
+	<<else>>
+		<<set $mara.nightCageCaughtUntil to Time.date.timeStamp + (((31 * 60) - (Time.hour * 60 + Time.minute)) * 60)>>
+	<</if>>
+	<<link [[Wait for Mara to come and investigate|Mara Pet Cage Night Caught]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
+<</if>>
+
+:: Mara Pet Cage Night Caught
+Mara opens the cage, takes the pick from your hand, and gives you a cold, unimpressed look. "Really? You thought you could make that much noise and I wouldn't notice? Out. You're coming with me. An hour in the discipline room should remind you why I keep that cage locked."
+<br><br>
+<<link [[Follow Mara to the dungeon (1:00)|Mara Pet Cage Night Discipline]]>><<pass 60>><</link>>
+
+:: Mara Pet Cage Night Discipline
+Mara closes the dungeon door behind you. The next hour is spent in a stern, controlled disciplinary session. The details remain private; the time passes slowly under her watchful attention.
+<br><br>
+Mara finally sets the implements aside. "That's enough. Up. You're going back where you belong."
+<br><br>
+<<if $worn.neck.cursed isnot 1>>
+	<<if $worn.neck.name is "leather collar">><<attach_leash true>><<elseif $worn.neck.name isnot "leather collar with leash">><<leash 24 "black">><</if>>
+<</if>>
+Mara clips the lead to your collar and guides you back to the cage.
+<br><br>
+<<if Time.date.timeStamp gte $mara.nightCageCaughtUntil or Time.hour gte 7>>
+	Mara opens the cage and removes the lead. "It's seven already. You're free of the cage, but don't mistake that for permission to wander off. Back to the pet room."
+	<br><br>
+	<<if $worn.neck.name is "leather collar with leash">><<detach_leash true>><</if>><<set $mara.nightCageCaughtUntil to 0>>
+	<<link [[Return to the pet room|Mara Danube Pet House]]>><</link>>
+<<else>>
+	She helps you onto the cushion, closes the door, and turns the key again. "There. No more attempts. You stay here until seven."
+	<br><br>
+	<<link [[Settle back onto the cushion|Mara Pet Cage Night]]>><</link>>
+<</if>>
+
+:: Mara Pet Cage Night Sleep
+<<set _autosavehere to true>>
+<<set $location to "town">><<set $bus to "mara_pet_cage">>
+/* Sleep in full hours, then pass the remaining minutes to exactly 07:00. */
+<<set $sleephour to Math.floor(((7 * 60 - (Time.hour * 60 + Time.minute) + 1440) % 1440) / 60)>>
+<<sleep>>
+<<passTimeUntil 7>>
+<<effects>>
+<<wakingEffects $sleepHoursTotal>>
+You sleep on the cushion inside the locked cage. At exactly seven in the morning, footsteps approach and a key turns in the lock.
+<br><br>
+<<sleepeffects>>
+<<include "Mara Pet Cage Night Morning">>
+
+:: Mara Pet Cage Night Morning
+<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<set $bus to "mara_pet_cage">>
+<<if $worn.neck.name is "leather collar with leash">><<detach_leash true>><</if>>
+<<set $mara.nightCageCaughtUntil to 0>>
+At seven, Mara unlocks the cage and swings the door open. She gives you a curt look. "Morning. Out. You can return to the pet room, and don't make me regret letting you out."
+<br><br>
+<<link [[Climb out and return to the pet room|Mara Danube Pet House]]>><</link>>
+
